# DORA AI — Backend Configuration
# =============================

# --- GROQ (FREE - RECOMMENDED) ---
# 1. Go to https://console.groq.com
# 2. Sign up / Log in
# 3. Get your API key (starts with: gsK... or gr0...)
# 4. REPLACE the key below
OPENAI_API_KEY=gsK_your_groq_api_key_here
PROVIDER=groq

# --- OPENROUTER (PAID) ---
# 1. Go to https://openrouter.ai/keys
# 2. Sign up / Log in  
# 3. Get your API key (starts with: sk-or-v1-...)
# 4. Replace the key below and set PROVIDER=openrouter
#OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your_key_here
#PROVIDER=openrouter

# --- IMPORTANT ---
# If using Groq, you MUST use a Groq key (gsK...), NOT your OpenRouter key!
# Groq key format: gsK... or gr0...
# OpenRouter key format: sk-or-v1-...
# These keys are NOT interchangeable!
